  "answer": "According to the Carnegie Mellon staff handbook:\n\n- **Unpaid meal periods**: They last **at least one half-hour (30 minutes), but not more than one hour** [1][2].\n- **Paid break time**: Scheduled breaks are optional and department-determined; if scheduled, they are **limited to 15 minutes per day and are paid** [2].",
